/** Вожак (h0E5…u00X Just Fight: те же числа; их особые способности кастовал бы ИИ — у владельца монстров его нет) */
function leader(int id, int base, string name, string model, int hp, int armor, int damage, int sides, real cooldown, int range, AttackType attackType)
	new UnitDefinition(id, base)
		..setName(name)
		..setTooltipBasic(name)
		..setTooltipExtended("")
		..setModelFile(model)
		..setNormalAbilities("")
		..setHitPointsMaximumBase(hp)
		..setDefenseBase(armor)
		..setArmorType(ArmorType.Hero)
		..setAttack1DamageBase(damage)
		..setAttack1DamageNumberofDice(1)
		..setAttack1DamageSidesperDie(sides)
		..setAttack1CooldownTime(cooldown)
		..setAttack1Range(range)
		..setAttack1AttackType(attackType)
		..setAttack1TargetsAllowed("ground,structure,debris,air,item,ward")
		..setSpeedBase(200)
		..setAcquisitionRange(900.0)
		..setSightRadiusNight(1000)
		..setCanFlee(false)
		..setUnitClassification("giant")
		..setScalingValue(1.5)
		..setManaMaximum(60)
		..setManaInitialAmount(60)
		..setGoldCost(0)
		..setLumberCost(0)
		..setFoodCost(0)
		..setBuildTime(1)
		..setUpgradesUsed("")
		..setNameEditorSuffix("(PvE вожак)")

